  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Aviation Namibia Planning Grant - Civil Aviation Namibia Plannin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Luftfartsverket Namibia Planeringsbidrag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Parterna planerar att genomf&#xF6;ra ett akt&#xF6;rsm&#xF6;te i Namibia f&#xF6;r att ta fram ett f&#xF6;rsta underlag f&#xF6;r ett akt&#xF6;rssamverkansprojekt inom omr&#xE5;det civil luftfart. Under bes&#xF6;ket ska omr&#xE5;den f&#xF6;r ett framtida samarbete definieras liksom kommande samarbetsparters. De f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntade resultaten av insatsen &#xE4;r gemensamt framtaget f&#xF6;rslag till samarbetsprojekt mellan LFV och NDCA/NAC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partners intend to implement an actor meeting in Namibia to develop a first basis for a partner driven cooperation in the field of civil aviation. During this visit, the areas for future cooperation will be defined and also future collaborators. The expected results of the project is to jointly develop proposals for cooperation between LFV and NDCA / NAC.</narrative>
  </description>
